                                "sense_id": "a981f389-cccd-3bdf-af19-3c5f2f0e8f85",
                                "text": "Umm, can you tell me the name of the sefer of Rav Nachman's where he wrote this, and where I can get it ? And how the quote originally goes in Hebrew or Yiddish or Russian or whatever language he wrote in ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9ec77e3-a24f-4689-8972-0220cdedc34d",
                                "sense_id": "a981f389-cccd-3bdf-af19-3c5f2f0e8f85",
                                "text": "and I'm not referring to Rabbi Sally or Rabbi Suzy from the non-O clergy, or for that matter Rabbi Murray or Rabbi Irving from the O clergy, or even from some naarishkeit written from Aish haTorah or Artscroll; but to a recognized Posek who has authored \"sefarim\""
                            },
