                                "sense_id": "a981f389-cccd-3bdf-af19-3c5f2f0e8f85",
                                "text": "Since R' Shlomo Wolbe spent more years speaking Hebrew than did Josh and wrote several sepharim in that language, I take it for granted he didn't make a grevious^([sic]) grammatical error."
